Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 20:39:12 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] nested: GLORYS through the same four gateway sections
 (glorys_gateways), drawn on the gateway plot

glorys_gateways(child, parent_dataset, dates, output_dir; days) samples GLORYS's daily means at noon of each day,
interpolated onto the child grid and rotated into its frame as the initial state is, and writes
glorys_gateways.csv with the model's section code; plot_gateways.jl adds them as black dots. Faces where the
velocity is not finite carry nothing, and where T or S is not, volume only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AbhhvpGsnzaJJu3V9mqrum
